{"server":"cn","storyId":"act18d0_level_act18d0_02_beg","groupId":"act18d0","stageId":"act18d0_02","title":"绿洲惊雷","storyCode":"WD-2","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act18d0/level_act18d0_02_beg.txt","sourceHash":"2199564de2d338029a655c8f9f14e374be125c9cfa593fb707c88fafc4fb884e","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"2上"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"十七年前\n3:09 P.M.  天气/晴\n乌萨斯，移动城市切尔诺伯格主航道西北侧一百四十七公里，村落"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutry_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"村庄......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"快，快，医生说要准备温水！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"这突然要上哪儿去找温水......问问玛莎，问问她家早上烧的水还有剩的没。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"皇帝在上，求求您保佑老头子吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"打扰一下......这里发生什么事了，您说的医生是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，你......您是谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"您从哪里来......您这身打扮，是城里来的？抱歉，抱歉，我们现在得忙着救人......您不介意的话，跟我往这儿走，至少能坐一坐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系......我就是来找那个医生的。她叫什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"您......您不会是来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她只是一个可疑的医生，你们很信任她吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"可她......可只有她能救好老头子啦，求求您，我求求您，至少现在，她只是个救人的医生啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不是来抓她的。我只是找她有点事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能为我带路吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我不知道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也算是个医生。也许我能帮上忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，看您这身打扮，驮兽也知道您的才学......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你可以先告诉凯尔希医生，告诉她，她的学生莉莉娅来探望她了，问问她需不需要帮手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，原来您知道医生的名字，您是叫莉莉娅，是吗？好的，好的，真是个好听的名字，您请稍等，我这就去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，喂！别忘了让玛莎送温水来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutryinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"病患","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃，呃啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"咬紧牙关，坚持住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"病患","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃啊啊啊——咕——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......凯尔希......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是什么情况？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"遭到野兽袭击，应急处理罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"刀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，呃......在、在哪里......我找不着......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这儿，给。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......感染生物？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......会感染吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"大部分感染生物都比人们想象的要干净，看齿痕，应该是附近游荡的獠兽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......但如果是误触了活性源石的獠兽......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"感染生物也许有办法和各种病菌和平共处，但是人类不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"情况很严重，不光是源石感染，还有坏死症状。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"病患","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"痛......好痛......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"冷静些，深呼吸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"病患","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呼——喝——呼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼吸困难，可能是血栓。都是急性矿石病的症状。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"但，但不是身上冒出石头才是矿石病吗！？老头子他这不是没事吗！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"某些情况下，感染源会在血液里迅速循环，不会像普通的矿石病那样出现体表源石结晶，而是在短时间内迅速加剧感染症状。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不靠药物抑制......唔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"皇帝在上，皇帝在上......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......你学得很多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"注射器，在那个灰色的药箱里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"给......你都随身带着这种抑制药物吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"总有必要的时候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"病患","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等等......咳咳，医、医生......这个，很贵吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"都什么时候啦！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"不贵，不用在意。现在当务之急是抑制你的急性矿石病反应，避免源石结晶粉尘的爆发。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你不希望村里的其他人因为你而受难，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"病患","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......唔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"稳住呼吸，别紧张。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你不会有事的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"病患","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃，好的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"病患","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘶——哈——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"病患","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃......嘶......医、医生......我不想......变成感染......咳咳......感染者......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"很遗憾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"病患","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我......呜......我......咳咳......咳咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"窒息，但我们没有呼吸机......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"这里什么都没有，但不代表我们什么都不该做。把喷雾拿来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"医生！医生！求求你救救这个糟老头子吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"在源石粉尘渗入他创口的那一瞬间，他注定会成为一名感染者，而我能做的只是尽力延续他的生命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"病患","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，咳咳咳——呼，哈——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抑制剂还没有生效吗！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"考虑到患者年龄，抑制剂本身就有极大风险，保持耐心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"病患","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......哈......哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼吸平稳些了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"病好了吗？他的病好了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果是指急性症状的话，也许是的。但如果是说矿石病的话，我们无能为力，谁都无能为力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么会......那如果纠察队的老爷来了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"病患","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那就，那就把我......把我供出去！我本来就没几年好活了......感染就感染吧......别让那些读过书的小伙子四处乱说就行......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"不！不会的，不会的，只要把你藏好，不会有人发现的，大家都会把你藏好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"医生，谢谢您了，医生，虽然这不是最好的结果，但我们......我们也没有什么东西可以报答您......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"这只是医生的职责。成为感染者之后的道路......才是你们需要考虑的。很抱歉，环境不允许我做更多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......抑制剂起效了，但是伤口仍旧有感染，会导致他的血栓恶化......也许我们得手术切除......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你的判断是正确的，老先生，咬紧牙关。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"病患","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊，好......好......呃啊，唔——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_iceforest_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"辛苦了，莉莉娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好久不见，凯尔希所长。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"好久不见，边走边说吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"也许......你并不愿意在那场屠杀之后还这样与我对话，但我打心底里庆幸你还活着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......在那之后，你一直躲藏在这里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那边的山丘上，可以眺望到切尔诺伯格的高楼。如果是我，不会选在一个离航道这么近的地方藏身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是暂作停留而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......你在那之后都做了些什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我不希望仇恨在你们之间继续连绵流淌。特别是，这股仇恨不光会使人采取自毁般的行径，更会招来那些凶手的直接报复。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你是在故意说给我听的，对不对？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我不否认，莉莉娅。但是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希医生，您出门？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，这位......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"是我的学生，不必紧张，她是来接我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，原来是这样......不过，说是来接您的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"皇帝在上呀......您还是要走了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"如果您要走了，请一定要告诉我们一声呀！您治好了我们的女儿，至少，请让我们为您送行！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"会的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌萨斯村民","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，好，好，那我们就不打扰二位了，离开之前，请一定要告诉我，凯尔希医生......请别忘了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_iceforest_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你似乎很受这里人的欢迎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"他们表露出了足够多的善意，我只是尽了医生的本职而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......其实他们的生活才是乌萨斯大部分人的面貌。待在研究所里久了，我们都忘了不少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"即使刻意靠近移动城市的航道，也并不能为他们带来机遇与繁荣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"恰恰相反，附庸权力的乡绅土豪为纠察队剥削贫民提供了更便利的土壤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"所以他们连一位医学院毕业的普通医生都请不起，一场普通的流感就能杀死一位年轻的少女。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的视野很广阔，是啊，一直如此......你还会治疗流感？我以为......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你以为我是个对着论文和数据指指点点的科学家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老实说，你比我想的更接近一个医生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"也许我从一开始就是个医生。只是医治的对象和抗争的病灶在不断变化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你的学生才会那么信任你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......莉莉娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你的女儿呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我把她交给了我的朋友。她和这一切都毫无瓜葛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她还......那么小，她还不会说话，她甚至还不会行走......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就这么抛弃了我的孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你本可以不这么做，如果你希望和路易莎隐姓埋名地生活下去的话——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你应该知道我的想法，凯尔希所长。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是想要阻止你。但如果你的女儿都做不到让你停下脚步，也许我的话你也听不进去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是啊。你挺清楚的呀。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutry_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今年的冬天很冷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"万比洛夫的父亲因为儿子的死发了疯，他在他湖边的阁楼里圈养着羽兽，每天都幻想着自己和儿子打猎的时光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊利亚的孩子，柳德米拉，她也还小，但她已经足以理解一部分无法挽回的事情，没人知道她如今到底过得如何。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有罗曼诺维奇，他的家人们变卖了所有的财产，离开了那座城市。即使他的兄弟根本不相信什么事故，但有人让他们闭嘴了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......至于更多人，警察提供了一份事无巨细的事故报告。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在那份“事故伤亡名单”里，没有任何人离开切尔诺伯格的研究所。一场实验事故引发的连锁反应，还有军方提供的尸体身份鉴定报告。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但某种直觉告诉我......有人活着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"直觉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为在那之后，所有受害者家属都或多或少受到了匿名的帮助——以及警告。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不觉得那个怯懦无能的鲍里斯侯爵，或是谢尔盖那个叛徒会有什么慈悲之心，所以，一定有其他知情者活了下来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可直到三年后的今天我才找到你，凯尔希所长，我才找到你，你藏得可真好，你甚至能骗过秘密警察的眼睛......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"在刑侦方面，他们过于依赖乌萨斯最新的技术，但这反而为我创造了机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然......你是个公认的天才，无与伦比的科研领袖，否则大家也不会对你心服口服。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"——请如实告诉我，莉莉娅，有多少人参与了你的计划？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......六七个吧。也许更多，我们不敢公然团结在一起，会被抓住把柄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"包括我在内。所有人都在那场“事故”中失去了一些无法挽回的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你从什么时候开始谋划这件事的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从我得知第四集团军的爪牙在那个研究所射出的第一枚弩箭，就罪恶地贯穿了我孩子的父亲的脖颈时，从那时开始。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"莉莉娅......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我并非有勇无谋。虽然因为身体原因，我和你们共事的时间很短，但是......我也做到了一些事情，比如——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你找到了万尼亚大公的所在，那所建立在移动城市之外的松心山谷疗养院。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"而这位第四集团军前参谋，也极可能是石棺事件幕后推动人之一的乌萨斯大公，也许正处于他漫长的征战生涯中守备最脆弱的时期。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你想进行一次刺杀，莉莉娅，但这次复仇依旧算得上“有勇无谋”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我算是明白，为什么丈夫他......阿斯特罗夫他会那么钦佩你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"但你要知道，莉莉娅，杀死一位年迈的大公根本没有任何意义。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"也许从一开始，那个年迈到在演讲时需要注射强心剂的万尼亚就不是真正的凶手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，凯尔希，我知道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可难道我把路易莎托付给他人的时候，就只是为了一个理性的结果，一次所谓的正义的审判吗？你不会猜不到的，凯尔希。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"盲目的复仇只会使你短视。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希，凯尔希，也许你不会明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"路易莎甚至都没学会说“爸爸”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_u"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"坐吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你在这里呆了多久？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"不值一提的时间，莉莉娅，你的脸色很差，你需要休息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你是如何找到我的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是偶然......如果不是这个偶然，也许我根本发现不了你还活着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......柳德米拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们不愿意孩子们受到太多伤害，起先，我们是打算找柳德米拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但那时候，从柳德米拉的保姆那里得知，有人在保持着对她们的联络和帮助。是个匿名角色，但她似乎对一切都了如指掌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也是这个匿名者，甚至都为她准备好了离开乌萨斯的办法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那时候我就确信，还有人活着。而据我所知，能办成这件事的人，寥寥无几。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"喝杯茶吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还以为你会迫不及待地询问我疗养院的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"莉莉娅，我想迫不及待的人，其实是你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"关于这件事，原来你一直都知道万尼亚身在何方......你就真的作壁上观？你应该知道他掌握着什么秘密！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"真正的秘密已经在伊利亚的坚持下被永远封存在了那个研究所。时至今日，军队也没能从中得到半点他们垂涎的好处。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"而万尼亚大公身患顽疾，每年冬天都会在松心山谷疗养。只要有办法混入任何一次所谓上流社会的沙龙，就不难得到这个情报。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......他甚至会四处夸耀那座疗养院的美丽与宽广。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。那座疗养院里有不少战功卓越的乌萨斯军人，当然，也有官僚和贵族。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"潜入那里并暗杀一位大公，其荒唐程度并不亚于你在切尔诺伯格持刀闯入鲍里斯侯爵的宅邸，割开他的喉咙再全身而退。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说的没错。但对于“官僚和贵族”们而言，那里的警戒依旧薄弱到让人蠢蠢欲动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我不否认。可你怎么知道那不是一个讯号，一个万尼亚大公不再位高权重的讯号，又或者......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或者万尼亚大公已经被某些人安排好了命运？我说过，凯尔希，我要的不是一次公正的审判。说直白点，我渴求的是一场私刑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在不是讨论正义和道德的时候，凯尔希，只有高枕无忧的人才喜欢用“客观”做挡箭牌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"万尼亚大公被军方或者皇帝本人问责，变成替死鬼，或者在政斗中站错了队，遭到流放，被集团军雪藏......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——无论怎样，哪怕他最后惨死于绞刑架，那又与我何干呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是他推动着切尔诺伯格的一切变得更糟，我只知道，他应该付出代价，“向我们”付出代价！他是杀了我孩子父亲的凶手！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我在听......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已经想好了混入疗养院的方法......但我也得承认，即使那里的警戒薄弱得可疑，也不代表我们中的任何人可以轻松得手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我找到了一个突破口。一个在贵族疗养院当了三十几年安全负责人，却忌惮贵族而不敢轻易捞取任何油水的家伙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在......同僚们的帮助下准备了一大笔钱，那个一事无成的，眼看着就要退休的老家伙一口就答应了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们花了很多力气才让他相信，我只是个乡下暴发户的女儿，为了傍上某位贵族或者将校才想进入疗养院实习工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你希望我帮你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，无论何种形式的身份伪造都有风险，但我想，疗养院总不至于和情报机构交流密切，那么——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果就连秘密警察都误以为你死了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——那死亡将使你畅通无阻。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_003_kalts","aliases":["凯尔希","莉莉娅"]}]}
